            <h3>Purpose</h3>
            <p>Organizes long troubleshooting/help content into expandable sections and can optionally recommend which section to open first.</p>
            <h3>How to implement</h3>
            <pre><code>&lt;BuzzAccordion
    Label="Support Case Playbook"
    Sections="@_guideAccordionSections"
    AllowMultipleOpen="false"
    ShowRecommendationHint="true"
    EnableAiRecommendedSection="true"
    AutoRecommendOnLoad="true"
